<Base title="Projects" description="Systems I have built and run, written up with their decisions, numbers and failures.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="meta">Projects</p>
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="lede">Systems I have built and run, with the decisions behind them, the numbers, and what broke.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
    <a class="card" href="/projects/gpu-platform/">
      <div class="tag">open source</div>
      <h3>gpu-platform</h3>
      <p>A Kubernetes platform that shares one GPU with production work through a fair queue. kubeadm, Cilium, Argo CD, Terraform, Prometheus, admission policy, 13 ADRs.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="/projects/agent-production-line/">
      <div class="tag m">case study</div>
      <h3>A production line of AI agents</h3>
      <p>About fifteen agents with roles, quality gates and a dispatcher on one GPU. What held up, what failed, and how it compares with the research.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="/how-this-site-runs/">
      <div class="tag">infrastructure</div>
      <h3>This site</h3>
      <p>Astro on S3 and CloudFront, Terraform, GitHub Actions with OIDC and no stored keys.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
